    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present No. 17 Millrace Garden to the market. This exceptional four-bedroom, four-bathroom family home has been thoughtfully reconfigured and extended to provide approximately 172 sq.m. of beautifully appointed accommodation over three levels. Presented in pristine, showhouse condition throughout, this impressive property combines generous proportions, high-quality finishes and a superb location within easy walking distance of Saggart Village and the LUAS.\n\nUpon entering, the welcoming extended porch leads into a bright entrance hall with excellent storage. The heart of the home is the impressive open-plan living, dining and kitchen area, which has been cleverly designed to maximise both space and natural light. The kitchen has been upgraded to a high standard with quality fitted units, while the generous living and dining areas provide an ideal setting for both everyday family life and entertaining.\n\nTo the rear, a substantial extension provides the additional living room, creating excellent flexibility for modern family living. Large windows and doors flood the accommodation with natural light and provide a seamless connection to the private rear garden. A utility room and guest bathroom complete this level.\n\nThe upper floors provide four spacious bedrooms and three further bathrooms. The principal bedroom is particularly impressive, benefiting from an ensuite and access to a private balcony, while a further bedroom also enjoys its own balcony space. The bathrooms throughout the property have been upgraded to a high standard, complementing the overall quality of the accommodation. High-quality flooring has been fitted throughout, while ample storage is provided across all three levels.\n\nTo the front, there is on-street parking, while the private rear garden provides an excellent outdoor space for relaxing and entertaining.\n\nThe location is superb, with Saggart and Rathcoole villages both within easy reach, offering an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and recreational amenities. The nearby LUAS provides convenient access to Dublin city centre, while the N7, N81 and M50 offer excellent connectivity for commuters.\n\nNo. 17 represents a rare opportunity to acquire a truly turn-key family home of exceptional quality and generous proportions in a highly sought-after location. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the standard, space and versatility this wonderful home has to offer."
      },
      {
